  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> has conjugate complex roots and they satisfy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math> then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "7DC4q",
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1Lj5c",
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Df2cJ",
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Zrgsr",
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math> be&nbsp;one of the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>.</p><p>So, its other conjugate complex root will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math>.</p><p>We know that for a quadratic equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, the sum and product of its roots are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;respectively.</p><p>So, the sum of roots of the given equation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Also, the product of roots of the given equation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>45</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Now, given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Subtracting equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Comparing from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi></mi><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math>.</p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence, option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is correct.</p>",
